# KubeMind — example environment.
#
# Nothing here is required: `kubemind` runs with your existing kubeconfig and
# no configuration at all. Copy to `.env` and source it only for the settings
# you actually want.
#
#   cp .env.example .env && set -a && . ./.env && set +a && kubemind
#
# For a persistent, commented config file instead, run: kubemind config init
# Precedence: command-line flags > these variables > the config file.

# ── Cluster ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# KUBECONFIG=~/.kube/config
# KUBEMIND_CONTEXT=my-cluster          # default: your kubectl current-context

# ── Server ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Loopback by default. KubeMind has no login of its own and can apply, delete,
# and exec with your credentials, so widen this only behind an authenticating
# proxy — and set KUBEMIND_ALLOW_REMOTE=1 to confirm you meant it.
# KUBEMIND_ADDR=127.0.0.1:7654
# KUBEMIND_ALLOW_REMOTE=0
# KUBEMIND_NO_BROWSER=1                # don't open a browser on start
# KUBEMIND_DESKTOP=1                   # open the desktop window instead

# ── AI assistant (all optional; everything else works without it) ──────────
# Pick ONE of the three blocks below, or leave them all unset and add a model
# from the UI (✨ → ⚙ Model Connections).

# Hosted Claude:
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# KUBEMIND_AI_MODEL=claude-opus-5

# Fully local, nothing leaves your machine (ollama serve && ollama pull llama3.2):
# KUBEMIND_AI_PROVIDER=ollama
# OLLAMA_HOST=http://localhost:11434
# KUBEMIND_AI_MODEL=llama3.2

# Any OpenAI-compatible server (LM Studio, vLLM, llama.cpp, LocalAI, OpenRouter):
# KUBEMIND_AI_PROVIDER=openai
# OPENAI_BASE_URL=http://localhost:1234/v1
# OPENAI_API_KEY=                       # often unnecessary for local servers
# KUBEMIND_AI_MODEL=your-model-id

# ── Ground answers in your own docs (optional) ─────────────────────────────
# KUBEMIND_DOCS_URL=https://docs.example.com/docs/
# KUBEMIND_DOCS_PATH=docs
# KUBEMIND_DOCS_TOPK=4
# KUBEMIND_DOCS_RAG_ENABLED=1
